<title>USA: CBOT July soybeans rally in commercial buying.</title>
<headline>CBOT July soybeans rally in commercial buying.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT July soybeans shot higher on buying linked to commercial firms and July soymeal was also sharply higher, floor traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Cargill just bought four million (bushels) of July and that is what rallied us,&quot; a floor source said.</p>
</text>
